### 4. `multiple_child_classes.py`

```python
from abc import ABC, abstractmethod

class Payment(ABC):

    @abstractmethod
    def pay(self):
        pass

class UPI(Payment):

    def pay(self):
        print("Payment using UPI")

class CreditCard(Payment):

    def pay(self):
        print("Payment using Credit Card")

u = UPI()
c = CreditCard()

u.pay()
c.pay()
```

